{"ticker":"BDX","updated":"2026-11-27T22:40:24Z","profile":{"longName":"Becton, Dickinson and Company","shortName":"Becton, Dickinson and Company","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bd.com","fullTimeEmployees":62000,"marketCap":59469119488,"trailingPE":43.35178,"forwardPE":15.419655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0564384,"pegRatio":7.07,"targetMeanPrice":226.14285,"targetHighPrice":242.0,"targetLowPrice":195.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.054,"earningsGrowth":0.486,"grossMargins":0.47355998,"operatingMargins":0.16508,"profitMargins":0.05885,"totalRevenue":19456999424,"beta":0.28,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":222.78,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":140.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.92},"summary":"Becton, Dickinson and Company develops, manufactures, and sells medical supplies, devices, laboratory equipment, and diagnostic products for healthcare institutions, physicians, clinical laboratories, reference laboratories, pharmaceutical industry, and the general public worldwide. It operates through Medical Essentials, Connected Care, BioPharma Systems, and Interventional segments. The company provides peripheral intravenous (IV) and advanced peripheral catheters, central lines, acute dialysis catheters, vascular access technology, vascular care and preparation products, needle-free IV connectors and extensions sets, closed-system drug transfer devices, hazardous drug detections, hypodermic syringes and needles, anesthesia needles and trays, enteral syringes, and sharps disposal systems; IV medication safety and infusion therapy delivery systems, medication compounding workflow system, automated medication dispensing and supply management systems, informatics and analytics and pharmacy automation system, and medication inventory optimization and tracking system; hemodynamic monitoring system; and prefillable drug delivery systems. It also provides hernia and soft tissue repair, synthetic mesh, biological and bioresorbable graft, biosurgery, and other surgical products; surgical infection prevention, peripheral intervention, and urology and critical care products; as well as ","summary_zh":"Becton, Dickinson and Company 為全球醫療機構、醫生、臨床實驗室、參考實驗室、製藥業和公眾開發、製造和銷售醫療用品、設備、實驗室設備和診斷產品。它透過醫療必需品、互聯護理、生物製藥系統和介入部門進行運作。該公司提供週邊靜脈（IV）和先進的周邊導管、中心導管、急性透析導管、血管通路技術、血管護理和準備產品、無針靜脈注射連接器和延長套件、封閉系統藥物傳輸裝置、危險藥物檢測、皮下注射器和針頭、麻醉針頭和托盤、腸內注射器和銳器處理系統；靜脈用藥安全和輸液治療輸送系統、藥物配製工作流程系統、自動化藥物配藥和供應管理系統、資訊學和分析以及藥房自動化系統以及藥物庫存優化和追蹤系統；血流動力學監測系統；和預填充藥物輸送系統。它還提供疝氣和軟組織修復、合成網片、生物和生物可吸收移植物、生物外科和其他外科產品；外科感染預防、週邊介入、泌尿外科和重症監護產品；也","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":145.1258,"h":145.1258,"l":143.4906,"c":144.6541,"v":1715546},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":144.5755,"h":147.2013,"l":143.8286,"c":147.1462,"v":2040288},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":147.6415,"h":150.6604,"l":146.5566,"c":150.1101,"v":2991108},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":148.6242,"h":150.6918,"l":148.5456,"c":150.6289,"v":1620019},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":150.7626,"h":153.5613,"l":150.511,"c":152.2091,"v":1242871},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":152.4528,"h":152.4528,"l":149.9214,"c":150.9355,"v":1390423},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":151.3758,"h":152.217,"l":150.5582,"c":151.3601,"v":1057414},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":151.3443,"h":152.5943,"l":150.8333,"c":152.4607,"v":1414337},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":152.6179,"h":153.0503,"l":147.838,"c":148.6478,"v":1566595},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":148.8994,"h":149.3947,"l":146.3129,"c":146.6667,"v":1372997},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":146.9182,"h":148.7814,"l":146.2264,"c":146.7453,"v":1084762},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":145.8333,"h":148.4198,"l":145.8333,"c":148.0818,"v":1501087},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":147.4764,"h":149.033,"l":146.2028,"c":146.8318,"v":1455804},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":143.7186,"h":145.7311,"l":140.6525,"c":145.6525,"v":4354692},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":145.6682,"h":148.9937,"l":145.0786,"c":148.6635,"v":2472514},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":148.805,"h":152.0676,"l":